}`\n- Resume refuses a superseded capsule with `contract.ErrHandoffSuperseded`→409.\n\n### Reader interfaces (in `internal/panel/contract/readers.go`)\nAdded `ContradictionReader`, `ImpactReader`, `DossierReader`, `HandoffReader` (plus the `ErrHandoffSuperseded` sentinel). All four are implemented on the shared `*ProjectSource` in new file `internal/panel/deps_subsystems.go`, and wired as fields on the `Readers` struct + `NewReaders` in `deps.go` (all served by the single shared `projectSource`, like Project/Roles).\n\n### Handoff `ValidationDeps` wiring (`buildValidationDeps` in deps_subsystems.go)\nWired from the project's own stateless stores:\n- `PlanVersionExists` → `artifact.PlanStore{WorkspaceRoot: root}.Version` (maps `ErrPlanNotFound`/`ErrVersionNotFound` to false)\n- `RoleConfigRevision` → `roleconfig.Load(root).Revision`\n- `ContradictionsChanged` → contradiction store (a listed contradiction that left an open status counts as changed)\n- `DossierSuperseded` → dossier store current status\n\nLeft **nil** with `// TODO(handoff)` (Validate treats nil as \"cannot check → passing\"; never faked a failing result):\n- `TaskIsCurrent` — no cheap bd \"is-current\" check from a project root\n- `EvidenceExists` — evidence is session-scoped, not resolvable from a project root\n- `RepositoryStateMatches` — needs a git probe not available here\n\n### One design note\nThe generated `protocol` types have a strict `UnmarshalJSON` that rejects a body missing any schema-required field (including server-managed `id`/`version`). Added `internal/panel/api/decode.go`'s `decodeServerManaged`, which injects the server-managed fields (id, version, and store-defaulted status) before the strict decode, so a client can legitimately POST \"the record minus server fields.\"\n\n### Tests (`internal/panel/api/*_test.go`, fakes over real stores in temp dirs)\nCover contradiction list/get/create(+id assignment)/resolve-flow + illegal-transition 409 + not-found 404; impact query returns a result + nodes list/get + missing-subject 400; dossier create/get + finalize-blocked 409 (with blockers) + self-verify 409; handoff create/list + validate-resumable + resume-superseded 409.\n\n### Final gate\n`go build ./...`, `go vet ./internal/panel/...`, `gofmt -l internal/panel` (clean), `go test ./internal/panel/...` — all green (306 passed).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>209107</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>95</tool_uses><duration_ms>1307954</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>",
