uperseded`.\n\n### Optimistic concurrency / stale-base conflict\nLives in the **HTTP layer** (`AcceptProposalHandler`, section 3), NOT the store. The proposal carries `Base.RevisionHash`; at accept time it is compared to `store.Current(...).RevisionHash`. Mismatch → review flips to `conflicted`, HTTP 409, no write. `ArtifactReference.RevisionHash` = `sha256:` of canonical content (see `Hash` in `/Users/yunaz.ramadhan/Documents/PROJECT/punokawan/internal/artifact/hash.go`).\n\n## 2. `store.go` + `project_stores.go` — store contract &amp; project→root resolution\n\n`/Users/yunaz.ramadhan/Documents/PROJECT/punokawan/internal/artifact/store.go`\n- **`Store` interface** (`:25-39`) — the per-artifact-type contract every accept/proposal handler needs:\n  - `Current(id string) (protocol.ArtifactReference, error)`\n  - `Version(id string, version int) ([]byte, protocol.ArtifactReference, error)`\n  - `CreateVersion(id, workspaceID string, content []byte, now time.Time) (protocol.ArtifactReference, error)` — **the \"acceptance applier\".**\n  - `LockArtifact(id string) func()`\n- `var _ Store = (*PlanStore)(nil)` (`:41`). `RecipeStore` also satisfies it (asserted in recipe/store.go `:312`).\n\n`/Users/yunaz.ramadhan/Documents/PROJECT/punokawan/internal/artifact/project_stores.go`\n- `RootResolver func(projectID string) (root string, err error)` (`:16`) — injected func mapping project id → workspace root.\n- `ProjectStores struct { resolve RootResolver }` (`:33`); `NewProjectStores(resolve RootResolver) *ProjectStores` (`:40`).\n- `(p *ProjectStores) Plans(projectID string) (*PlanStore, error)` (`:56`) → `&amp;PlanStore{WorkspaceRoot: root}`.\n- `(p *ProjectStores) Reviews(projectID string) (*ReviewStore, error)` (`:69`) → `&amp;ReviewStore{WorkspaceRoot: root}`.\n\nHow HTTP layer gets these — `/Users/yunaz.ramadhan/Documents/PROJECT/punokawan/internal/panel/api/artifact_stores.go`:\n- `ArtifactStores struct { Plans *artifact.PlanStore; Recipes func() (*recipe.RecipeStore, err